# panel fixture: the STA knob turned clockwise pushes the step later, counter-clockwise pulls it earlier
# manual: p016
# workflow: Step zoom, step attributes
# p016: clockwise shows a Red bar, "delaying (pushing) the step"; further back shows a Green bar, "pulling the step to the front of the beat".
# Clockwise is the positive offset, which the Red bar draws.
given step 3 5 sta = 0
at 0 ms press mode.step
at 200 ms click step(3,5)
at 400 ms release mode.step
at 1000 ms turn edit.enc.sta 1
expect command SetStep track=3 step=4 attr=StartOffset value=1
expect commands 1
expect engine step 3 5 sta = 1
at 1500 ms turn edit.enc.sta -2
expect engine step 3 5 sta = -1
